  metaDescription:'A printable mixing-bowl flashcard for ages 3 and up: the big bowl that holds the batter, with a crack-and-stir setup that makes kids the head mixer.',
  intro:'The big cream bowl with the green stripe — the mixing bowl is where the batter lives, and it is the natural throne of every little helper: everything worth stirring happens in here.',
