  try:'Make your child the bin chief for a day: every wrapper, every peel, every scrap goes in by THEIR pedal-and-toss. Then hand them the kitchen\u2019s easiest real chore — emptying the little scraps bowl after dinner. Pedal, toss, close. Two-year-olds can do it; five-year-olds do it without being asked.',
